WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.849
The first card represents Daniel’s incoming request A supplier

00:00:04.915 --> 00:00:08.126
wants a morning slot and a virtual client discussion

00:00:08.126 --> 00:00:11.692
may move to a physical lunch The second card

00:00:11.744 --> 00:00:14.652
reminds us that these are not accepted changes

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:20.605
The diary contains existing commitments The supplier claims approval

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:25.131
but Daniel has not verified it Accepted arrangements for

00:00:25.184 --> 00:00:28.236
the afternoon visit do not automatically cover lunch

00:00:29.127 --> 00:00:32.482
Before opening the guidance write what Daniel can do

00:00:32.509 --> 00:00:36.916
now Name two unknowns and identify whose decision or

00:00:36.916 --> 00:00:41.048
acceptance is still needed You may improve this response

00:00:41.088 --> 00:00:41.561
later
